title: Confronting the Far RIght Threat
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: ap_r >= 20 and confronting_right_timer == 0 and jsu_formed == 0
on-arrival: confronting_right_seen += 1; confronting_right_timer = 5; month_actions += 1
card-image: img/generalisimo.jpg
tags: party_affairs; antifascism

# Forming the Iron Front

The CEDA and the reactionary right are gaining strength, as shown by their growing electoral presence and the aggressive mobilization of the JAP (Juventudes de Acción Popular). Their rhetoric threatens to undo the Social Republic and pave the way for an authoritarian regime.

Many in our party are calling for urgent action. 

- @not_a_big_deal: The CEDA's moment will pass. Gil-Robles is not Hitler. Let's not get too hasty.
- @economic_crisis
- @jsu

@not_a_big_deal
on-arrival: nazi_urgency -= 1; caballeristas_dissent += 15
view-if: araquistain_advisor = 0 and largo_caballero_advisor = 0 and nelken_advisor = 0

The CEDA is just another parliamentary right-party that will have to play by the rules of the constitutional order; we do not need to build an extraordinary strategy to combat them.

@economic_crisis
title: We must address the agrarian and economic crisis first.
view-if: economic_plan == 0 and asturias_revolution_seen == 1
go-to: crisis_program

@jsu
title: Form the Unified Socialist Youth!
subtitle: The Unified Socialist Youth consists of the PSOE and PCE's Youth Organization.
view-if: jsu_formed == 0
on-arrival: jsu_formed = 1; radicalization += 1; workers_psoe += 5*(1-dissent); pro_republic -= 5; prietistas_dissent -= 8; caballeristas_strength += 5
achievement: eiserne_front

The Reactionary threat can no longer be ignored. We must build a new organization to confront them - the Unified Socialist Youth.
